    "name": "Is a Walk-In Shower or Tub Better for an Accessible Bathroom Remodel?",
    "text": "Is a Walk-In Shower or Tub Better for an Accessible Bathroom Remodel?",
    "@type": "Question",
    "answerCount": 1,
    "acceptedAnswer": {
      "text": "A walk-in shower is often the better choice when stepping over a tub wall is difficult, but the best solution depends on available floor area, drainage, wall construction, transfer needs, and how the bathroom will be used. Compare entry type, seating, controls, support locations, water management, maintenance, and future flexibility before choosing.",
